<br><p id='bold_title'><u><i>10X TBE</i></u><br>
108 g Tris-base<br>
55 g boric acid<br>
9.3 g disodium EDTA<br>
pH should be around 8.3 without adjustment<br>
bring volume up to 1 L</p>

